    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_select_04",
      "hash64": "D6C2698EEA433E40",
      "text": "¡Que empiece el asalto!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_05",
      "hash64": "8FC7CA649BB09638",
      "text": "¡Te lo dije!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_07",
      "hash64": "FE3FECE5CC9BE88D",
      "text": "Miércoles, ¡¿y ahora qué?![VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_08",
      "hash64": "FE3FDDE5CC9BCF10",
      "text": "Ayer estuvimos jugando hasta las tantas.\\nSeguro que estos siguen durmiendo la mona...[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_06",
      "hash64": "8FC7CD649BB09B51",
      "text": "¡No te preocupes! ¡Yo l[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa entretengo mientras tú\\nvas a despertar a los demás!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_09",
      "hash64": "FE3FDEE5CC9BD0C3",
      "text": "¿Y por qué iba a fiarme de ti, eh?[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_07",
      "hash64": "8FC7CC649BB0999E",
      "text": "¡Si la base queda desprotegida, don Henzo\\ncorrerá peligro!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_08",
      "hash64": "8FC7C7649BB0911F",
      "text": "A él le debo mi vida. Es mi benefactor, mi\\ncamarada...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_09",
      "hash64": "8FC7C6649BB08F6C",
      "text": "¡Y, cuando un hermano se halla en un brete, uno\\nha de armarse de arrojo y acudir al rescate!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_10",
      "hash64": "FE42EBE5CC9E1CB1",
      "text": "Sí, lo que tú digas... ¡Lo dejo en tus manos,\\nentonces![VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_10",
      "hash64": "8FC449649BAD852E",
      "text": "¡Si osas interponerte en el camino de mi héroe,\\nhabrás de vértelas con un servidor, vil truhan[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]a!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_select_05",
      "hash64": "D6C26A8EEA433FF3",
      "text": "¡Vamos!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_select_06",
      "hash64": "D6C26B8EEA4341A6",
      "text": "Para el carro",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_11",
      "hash64": "8FC44A649BAD86E1",
      "text": "Como bien se dice por ahí, \"no huye el que se\\nretira\". Sabia decisión.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_12",
      "hash64": "8FC447649BAD81C8",
      "text": "¡¡EN GUARDIAAA!!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_13",
      "hash64": "8FC448649BAD837B",
      "text": "Don Henzo... Lo siento...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_01",
