    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_02",
      "hash64": "5F2035885202D859",
      "text": "Estaba montando guardia alrededor de la base\\ncuando percibí de repente un alboroto.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_03",
      "hash64": "5F2034885202D6A6",
      "text": "De modo que decidí venir para comprobar que\\ntodo estaba en orden...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_14",
      "hash64": "8FC44D649BAD8BFA",
      "text": "Arg... ¿Has pedido refuerzos? ¿Dónde está tu\\nhonor?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_04",
      "hash64": "5F2037885202DBBF",
      "text": "¿Este chico es... un alumno de la academia?\\nNo parece formar parte del Team Star.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_15",
      "hash64": "8FC44E649BAD8DAD",
      "text": "No, no lo soy... ¡Pero don Henzo es mi camarada\\ny se halla en apuros!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_16",
      "hash64": "8FC44B649BAD8894",
      "text": "Tengo que hablar con él sea como sea. Si no...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_05",
      "hash64": "5F2036885202DA0C",
      "text": "Parece que tienes tus motivos.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_06",
      "hash64": "5F2039885202DF25",
      "text": "Voy a tener una pequeña charla con él.\\nTú adéntrate en la base, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
